Package: statsEASE
Title: Reverse Engineering EASE and SCRAPI2 for Escapement Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("statsEASE", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fish.dzs0017@gmail.com")
Description: Teaching material that reverse engineers the two production
    escapement estimators used at Lower Granite Dam, EASE/escapeLGD for adults
    and SCRAPI2/smoltEASE for smolts, treating them as one estimator structure
    applied at two life stages. It holds a short talk track of self-contained R
    scripts and an interactive learnr course that rebuilds the compound
    bootstrap step by step against a known-truth simulated fishery.
